#. Description of the plugin
#: rmd-focal-zoom-point.php
msgid "Set a focal point and zoom on every image in the media library or right where it is used. Cropped images keep their important part in view, in any theme."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: rmd-focal-zoom-point.php
