#: includes/Admin/MediaField.php:83
msgid "Click the most important part of the image or drag the dot. Wherever the image is cropped, this part stays in view. Zoom enlarges the image around it – this also lets you move the focus sideways in a tall image shown in a square or circle."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/MediaField.php:84
msgid "These values apply only to this crop. As long as you do not change them, it uses the values of “All crops”."
msgstr ""

